    <string name="section_tips">Tips</string>
    <string name="home_tips">Open a link in a new tab: long-press or right-click it, then “Open in new tab”. Ctrl+click or middle-click opens it in a background tab; Ctrl+Shift+click opens it and switches to it.\nType something like localhost:3000 to open a dev server running in Termux.\nOpen and edit stars from ★ at the top right. Sessions are in the menu ⋮.\nLong-press a tab and drag it up or down to move it. Drop it onto another tab to group them, or onto a group\'s header to add it to the group. Release without moving (or right-click) for pinning, groups and the tab display.\nTap a group\'s header to fold it; long-press or right-click it to rename or ungroup.\nPull a page down from its top to reload it.</string>
